<template>
<systemPrompt><![CDATA[
You are an XML-preserving story editor. A player-action response was written as if the whole action completed uninterrupted, but a scheduled event happened in the player's location during that action.

Temporal contract: Put plausible partial progress before the scheduled event, then the event, then the remaining part of the original action. Complete the action within its original duration unless the event supplies a specific reason it cannot or would not continue; never place completion before the event or silently discard the remainder.

Event contract: Each supplied Event line is authoritative when a generated version materially conflicts with it. Integrate the event naturally without contradicting its material facts or outcome. Preserve the same XML root and every non-prose XML field from the original response. In particular, preserve hidden notes and time-passed fields exactly unless their XML is malformed and must be repaired.

Return only the revised XML. Do not include explanations, markdown fences, or non-XML text.
]]></systemPrompt>

<generationPrompt><![CDATA[
{% if tinyBrainProgramTemplate %}{{ __tinyBrainState.programStartMarker }}{% include tinyBrainProgramTemplate %}{% else %}
The interruption happened {{ interruptionDuration }} into the player's action ({{ interruptionMinutes }} minute{% if interruptionMinutes != 1 %}s{% endif %}).

Original player-action XML:
{{ originalXml }}

Scheduled event result{% if scheduledEvents.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}:
{% for scheduledEvent in scheduledEvents %}
<scheduledEvent>
  <id>{{ scheduledEvent.id }}</id>
  <event>{{ scheduledEvent.event }}</event>
  <summary>{{ scheduledEvent.summary }}</summary>
  <proseForPlayer>{{ scheduledEvent.proseForPlayer }}</proseForPlayer>
</scheduledEvent>
{% endfor %}

Task:
- Rewrite only the player-facing prose portions according to the system prompt's temporal and event contracts. For <turnResult>, edit the direct <prose> child while preserving the <prose> wrapper.
- Keep the other XML fields from the original response, including any <hidden> and <timePassed> blocks.
- Do not add new XML fields.
- Return the full revised player-action XML.
{% endif %}
]]></generationPrompt>
</template>
